This file catalogs the changes in software versions, removals, and fundamental changes encountered during
port to Rocky 10 

buildtools-admix:
   removed:
       inteltbb version: "20190605"  #binary distribution incompatible with Rocky 10
       java 1.8.0                    #old
 
   Fundamental Changes:
       java 11  - no longer in OS distribution. Build a local version with help of precompiled java for bootstrap
       java 17  - no longer in OS distribution. Build a local version with help of precompiled java for bootstrap

   Software affected by removals includes, at a minimum:
      inteltbb removal:
           bismark_0.22.3-module
           bismark_0.23.1-module   
           bowtie2_2.4.1 
           bowtie2_2.4.1-module 
           kneaddata_0.10.0-module 
           loompy_3.0.6-module 
           velocyto_0.17.17-module

      java 1.8.0 removal:
           bbmap_38.87-module
           fastqc_0.11.9-module
           hdf5_1.10.5_gcc_8.4.0-module
           hdf5_1.10.5_gcc_8.4.0_openmpi_4.0.3-module
           hdf5_1.10.5_gcc_system-module
           hdf5_1.13.1_gcc_8.4.0-module
           hdf5_1.13.1_gcc_system-module
           hdf5_1.13.1_gcc_system_openmpi_4.1.1-module
           kallisto_0.46.2-module
           kneaddata_0.10.0-module
           lammps_3Mar2020_gcc_8.4.0-module
           ncbi-ngs_2.10.2-module
           ncbi-vdb_2.10.2-module
           ncl_6.6.2-module
           netcdf-c_4.7.0_gcc_8.4.0-module
           netcdf-fortran_4.5.2_gcc_8.4.0
           picard-tools_1.87-module
           rosetta_3.13-module
           trimgalore_0.6.6-module
           trimgalore_0.6.7-module
           trimmomatic_0.39-module

foundation-admix:

    Specific versions per OS release:
      scons: 4.8.1  :  previous version "compiled" by had warnings of fully deprecated interfaces
       swig: 4.4.1  : 10 only has pcre2, previous version only supports pcre. First pcre2-compatible version is 4.1.0. 


mathlibs-admix:
    
   removed:
        mkl 2019.5.281 # Binary RPMS too old for PGP signatures to verify on 10

   Software affected by removals includes, at a minimum:
        amber_21.12_gcc_11.2.0-module
        amber_24_gcc_11.2.0-module
        amber_24_gcc_11.2.0_cuda_11.7.1_openmpi_5.0.1-module 
        namd_2.14b2_gcc_8.4.0
        namd_2.14b2_gcc_8.4.0-module
        namd_2.14b2_gcc_8.4.0_cuda_11.7.1
        namd_2.14b2_gcc_8.4.0_cuda_11.7.1-module
        namd_2.14b2_gcc_8.4.0_openmpi_4.0.3
        namd_2.14b2_gcc_8.4.0_openmpi_4.0.3-module
        plink_2.00a2.3-module
